      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but it feels a bit too safe/generic. i want to get into the real \"edge-lord\" territory for the set. like, can you actually write a few punchlines or setup-punchline jokes based on those? specifically the ones about the strict parents or being the \"tech guy\" who's constantly annoying everyone. i need to see where the line is so i know how much to push it on stage.",
