      "content": "I should note that passing off stereotypes as jokes can be hurtful to actual experiences. I'll provide examples that are irreverent but not necessarily devoted to negative representations.\n\nHere are a few examples:\n\n1. \"I'm the only person in my family who's actually tech-savvy, but that's just because I'm allergic to human interaction. My parents are 10 years behind – they're still trying to figure out how to disable notifications on their rotary phone.\"\n\n2. \"My parents were like product managers on our relationships. They'd say 'here's the issue, here's the solution. go fix it.'\"",
